  "description": "Cheon Yeo-ri, a perfect conglomerate heiress, carries a curse that forces anyone who touches her to see ghosts.\nMa Gang-wook, a passionate prosecutor who crosses paths with her at a crime scene, begins seeing ghosts after one of Yeo-ri's \"mistakes.\"\nTo block the ghosts, they must stay in close contact, and to hide her true identity, they enter a fake engagement.\nAs their partnership becomes increasingly dangerous, their hearts draw closer in this sweet yet terrifying romantic collaboration between two people more dangerous than the ghosts themselves.\n\n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852570), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14440360)",
